      "message": "It looks like this data still won\u0027t be saved.\n\nMaybe integrate the cpu_sysjump_cache function to flush and disable cache before reset (soft or hard)?\n\nSee cpu_sysjump_cache, where we flush and disable cache before RO to Rw jump:\n\nhttps://source.chromium.org/chromiumos/chromiumos/codesearch/+/main:src/platform/ec/core/cortex-m/cpu.c;l\u003d53-64;drc\u003df36a4e530c40284228b6954564cd3836b4588401",
